# W4-SQ-01: SOV02's MCV chain. The beach pillbox whose death is 'Land the
# MCV' is removed with a cheat (the beach assault stand-in); the Africans'
# transport arrives CARRYING the SMCV, unloads with Unload mode 0 (both stay
# in the team), 'Destroy MCV Team' frees the SMCV and 'MCV ON the Beach'
# hands it to the player.
set render_every 900
set on_quit continue
set campaign sov02t.MAP Nod
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
until 60 carried(0) >= 6
until 1500 carried(0) == 0
cheat camp_killb 1 GAPILL
until 3000 units(0,SMCV) >= 1
assert units(0,SMCV) >= 1
end
